-- Cities that reached five active rows through owners whose own pages say American / NMJL (see the 0230 promotion migration): published with a written intro.
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Gladstone''s mahjong centers on The Lucky League, which runs open play at The Lucky Tile from Tuesday through Saturday and organizes six-week leagues played by National Mah Jongg League rules, with supplies provided. It suits players who already know the basics and want regular games close to Kansas City. Bring a current NMJL card if you have one, and ask the club about beginner options before your first visit.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'gladstone';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Columbus mahjong moves around town: open play at Parker''s Pantry and the Columbus Botanical Garden, a Mahjong at the Museum evening, and lessons at places like Bloom Pastry & Pop and La-Z-Boy. Bam Good Time Columbus organizes the schedule, from Mahjong 101 for newcomers to Beyond the Basics. Sessions follow the National Mah Jongg League card. New players can start with a Mahjong 101 class.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'columbus-ga';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'In Naples, mahjong often comes with something else: a morning game at a design studio, a Wednesday session at a Pine Ridge Road fitness studio, a lunch at a cafe on 3rd Street. Mahjong Cafe, Naples Mahjong, Paradise Coast Mahjong and SWFL Mahjong are among the local groups, and the Naples Ladies Mah Jongg group, which plays the American version, meets through Meetup. Bring a current National Mah Jongg League card; beginners can start with a lesson.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'naples';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'In Havre de Grace, The Pink Mahj Squad organizes beginner American Mah Jongg classes, guided play and social play for all levels, most of them on South Union Avenue, with seasonal nights such as a Mah Jongg Masquerade at Battery Island Brewery. The classes are a gentle way in if you have never played, and the social sessions welcome every level. Check the club''s page for the current schedule and what to bring.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'havre-de-grace';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Columbia players can learn through the University of South Carolina''s continuing education Mah Jongg classes, taught by Twyla Stowe, or join an evening of open play with Mahjong with Alice, which moves between local venues such as Pitas, Hotel Trundle and Carlisle''s in Winnsboro. Mary Ellen Barnwell also teaches. Supplies are provided at the open-play nights and players bring their National Mah Jongg League card. If you are new, the university classes are a good place to start.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'columbia';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'The Royal Palm Mahjong Club in Fort Myers teaches American mahjong in a series of courses: Mahj 101 for beginners, Mahj 102 for the next level, and a beginner course just for men, with lessons that break down the National Mah Jongg League card. Sessions are held at the club''s own space, so it is easy to come back each week. If you are brand new, start with Mahj 101.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'fort-myers';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'On Johns Island, mahjong is a social night out. Little Palmetto Mahjong Johns Island hosts play at local breweries and distilleries, from a fall football social league at Charleston Distilling Co. to Cowgirl Mahjong open play at Low Tide Brewing. Bring your current National Mah Jongg League card. Check the group''s page before your first night to see which events suit newcomers.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'johns-island';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Centennial''s weekly game is Tuesday Night Mahjong at Koelbel Library, run by Lucky Tiles South Denver. It follows American mahjong rules. Beginners are welcome as long as they already know the basic rules, and everyone brings their own National Mah Jongg League card. If you are still learning the basics, take a lesson in Denver first, then join the library table.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'centennial';
